Package: hotnetR2
Title: Reproducible Regulatory Network Analyses with LDAK and HotNet
Version: 0.0.5
Authors@R: person("Yan", "Li", email = "yan.li@roswellpark.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Data preparation, identifier harmonization, enhancer classification,
    regional association scores, and hierarchical HotNet workflows. Integrates
    the hotnetR data interfaces with explicit gene-body and transcription-start
    site compatibility profiles and portable resource manifests.
